    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1#pta0029.pta002.4.s11",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0029.pta002.4.s11",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐ γὰρ ἄλλην ἐπέκτισεν, ἀλλὰ τὴν παλαιὰν ἀνεκαίνισε, καὶ ἣν ἤρξατο ποιεῖν ἐτελείωσε.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 420,
    "date_range": [
      340,
      500
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1#pta0029.pta002.4.s12",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0029.pta002.4.s12",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Διὰ τοῦτο ἐν μὲν τῇ ἕκτῃ τὰ γενόμενα συνετελέσθη, καὶ τῇ ἑβδόμῃ κατέπαυσεν ἀπὸ πάντων· ἐν δὲ τῷ Εὐαγγελίῳ ἐλθὼν ὁ λόγος φησίν· Ἦλθον τελειῶσαι τὸ ἔργον.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 420,
    "date_range": [
      340,
      500
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1#pta0029.pta002.4.s13",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0029.pta002.4.s13",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὁ γὰρ ἀπὸ πάντων καταπαύων, σημαίνει τινὰ δεῖσθαι τέλους, ἅπερ ἐλθὼν ἐπετελείωσε.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 420,
    "date_range": [
      340,
      500
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1#pta0029.pta002.4.s14",
    "work_id": "pta/pta0029/pta002/pta-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0029.pta002.4.s14",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Φησὶ γὰρ ἐν τῷ κατὰ Ἰωάννην· Τὰ ἔργα ἃ δέδωκέ μοι ὁ πατὴρ, ἵνα τελειώσω αὐτά· αὐτὰ τὰ ἔργα, ἃ ἐγὼ ποιῶ, μαρτυρεῖ περὶ ἐμοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 420,
    "date_range": [
      340,
      500
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
